Subject: [PATCH v7 18/22] Move EM_UNICORE to uapi/linux/elf-em.h
Message-ID: <20190107025431.GR1207@altlinux.org>
References: <20190107025101.GA1182@altlinux.org>
MIME-Version: 1.0
